1ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": ""}, {"time": "0000", "id": 1, "image": "engenn4le11ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good morning!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Fishmonger</span>: Hello, there! What can I do for you today?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This is my first time buying fish. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Fishmonger</span>: OK, what kind of fish do you like to eat?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Salmon, trout, tilapia ...<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Fishmonger</span>: We have each of those selections over here. How do you plan to prepare the fish?"}, {"time": "19500", "id": 2, "image": "engenn4le11ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... what do you recommend?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Fishmonger</span>: I think that getting a fillet of salmon and grilling it is best.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: OK.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Fishmonger</span>: How many people are you serving?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Just my aunt and I. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Fishmonger</span>: So, I can give you two fillets of salmon and two salmon steaks."}, {"time": "39000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn4le11ob03re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What's the difference?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Fishmonger</span>: The steaks are bigger and best on the barbecue.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How much is that all together?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Fishmonger</span>: $25.00.<br/>\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thank you very much."}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le11ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le11ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "A Day in Japantown", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Is This Fresh? ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Between the Market Stalls > Tokyo Fish Market", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "  Talking About Food", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are several ways to prepare food. When you talk about preparing food, you use <span class =\"strong\"> verbs </span> to talk about the actions you do. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can <span class =\"strong\">grill</span>  it (on the barbecue or a small grill at home).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can <span class =\"strong\">fry</span>  it (in a pan on the stove).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can <span class =\"strong\">boil</span>  it (in water).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can <span class =\"strong\">bake</span>   it (in the oven).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Grilling fish is the best way to prepare it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I like to fry my fish in garlic and olive oil. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I prefer to bake the fish in the oven with potatoes.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "salmon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a type of pink fish ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to eat salmon with garlic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use at the fish market.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tilapia ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a type of white fish with a light taste ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to grill the tilapia.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "trout ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a fish with pink flesh found in fresh water ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I prefer to bake the trout in the oven.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fillet ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of fish with no bones ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think a fillet of salmon is a good idea.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "barbecue ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an outside grill   ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The steaks are best on the barbecue.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob03re2img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Read the roles below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the situation with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles and practice again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role&nbsp;1 </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are a fishmonger. Your customer doesn't know much about fish. Answer their questions.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role&nbsp;2 </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are a customer at a fishmonger. You don't know a lot about fish. You must ask questions and leave with fish to cook later. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about shopping for food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for and provide information in a public place.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for and give suggestions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena"}